{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act17side_level_act17side_st04",
  "groupId": "act17side",
  "stageId": "act17side_04",
  "title": "臨海長街",
  "storyCode": "SN-ST-4",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "97267f7fd940b7ea69a338c383cb4d4575224a3d6ae0540b831118ef2b9d067e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——伊比利亞著名建築師、首席船舶設計師布雷奧甘的筆記副本，用晦澀的阿戈爾文字寫成。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是阿戈爾人之間的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你身在伊比利亞的國土上，律法便注視著你，我亦然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你與那三名深海獵人有什麼聯繫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你打傷過斯卡蒂，奇怪，她一定是打算避戰的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的血是特殊的，比我們所有人都特殊。希望你小心擦拭過你的武器了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提問的是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "決定是否回答的人是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡門閣下允許自由行動的獵人，似乎僅限於在鹽風城之戰中表明立場的阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，碰得到她，看來不全是偶然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她並不弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......弱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知輕重的評價。她只是對陸地感到生疏，欠缺變通的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要動，阿戈爾人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請配合長官的調查，深海獵人與審判庭締結了契約，你的一舉一動都在破壞我們建立的合作關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......合作？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請三思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "審判官，伊比利亞有多少你這樣的戰士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "與你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠不夠三千人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏爾比安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_445_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那伊比利亞還不夠格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別想走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（尖銳的摩擦聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？從哪裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官！您沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒事，那個阿戈爾人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我的失責！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他本可趁機取下我的手臂，卻選擇了逃走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我們還無暇追擊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是城鎮的方向！它們躲藏在泥土裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整片土地都遭到了污染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼會？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看清那些灰色的土地，彌漫著險惡氣息的土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蘭法洛並非遭受深海教會的滲透，而是已經淪陷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備迎戰。儘早確認卡門閣下的安危。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g18_lighthouse_square"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這螢光的溟痕，就像是它們的城市......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可思議，它們自溟痕之中誕生，它們借溟痕擴散遷徙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（詭異的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "並非所有生命都渴求獨立存在，難怪這些骯髒的東西能躲藏在這座小鎮裡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可又是誰將它們帶來了陸地上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibchurch"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這下好了，本以為這趟海邊之旅能給人帶來些靈感，這不是全泡湯了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（表示贊同的獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerId": "npc_2002_Dan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "海在撫摸著大地，我能感覺到，這很糟糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希說阿戈爾人打贏了一次，那些深海獵人就是那場戰爭的遺孤，可看現在這個架勢，根本不算贏了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，提到凱爾希，東西給了沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繞了一個大圈。她為什麼不直接給那個叫歌蕾蒂婭的阿戈爾人？這樣不是更快些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "npc_2003_Frost_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（疑問的獨奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她想靠這把鑰匙把我們吸引過來。那她確實做到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者，她本來真的打算讓我們去找回些什麼，或是幫點什麼忙。然後改了主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerId": "npc_2004_Alty",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？她不是一直那麼神機妙算嗎？有什麼東西逼她改變了想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......或許呢。她的知識多些是不假，但更多的是謹慎，不然她得死多少次？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerId": "npc_2001_Aya_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，你在比劃什麼？Dan？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerId": "npc_2002_Dan_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這座禮拜堂，很適合當Live House啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斯卡蒂，鯊魚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得見的敵人，我們都消滅了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無形的浪花在這裡延伸，就像沙灘上的潮汐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是種不祥的徵兆，我們，我們不該在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來清理一些垃圾，還不足以讓她找回感覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把這裡打掃乾淨，我們借伊比利亞人的手，找到那艘船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們身上有某些我們不知道的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或者，那些東西是恐魚的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我從以前就一直在想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼它們還能進化得如此迅速？為什麼它們還能如此富有活力？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們明明已經......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我們即將去弄清楚的問題。這也是我願意和凱爾希合作的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動起來，獵人，在太陽落山之前結束，聽不見海聲的恐魚只是一些低等生物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......歌蕾蒂婭？你來了，那我聽你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鯊魚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你手裡的，順手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它？我時常忘記這把武器就在我的手裡......我像是在和它跳舞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是你的過去，你的過去就快追上你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們等你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g18_lighthouse_square"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（顫抖的聲音）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不錯的行軍速度，達里奧，讓你安排的事情可妥當了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懲戒軍替我們備好了前往伊比利亞之眼的船。他們已經撤離海岸，包圍了這座小鎮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些誤入歧途的人，插翅難逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些宵小之輩不足為懼，但他們帶來的新的威脅，確實讓人驚訝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的科技足以清理這些污染。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這只是一時的勝利，達里奧。而且這是“阿戈爾的科技”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果潮汐拍打沙灘的每一分每一秒，每一滴水，每一顆沙粒都是恐魚及其生態的延伸，我們要如何捍衛家園？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會在那之前想出辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我們一定會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而那些深海獵人，審判庭也已做好交戰的準備。我們會將她們扼殺在這偏遠的海岸線上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡是合適的墳場。希望她們足夠明智，也希望凱爾希能做到她承諾的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這位就是你的徒弟......我在審判庭就聽說過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是、是！審判官艾麗妮，向您報到，卡門長官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說達里奧在廢墟中找到你的時候，一本厚重的經卷卡住了傾斜的房梁，以一種不可思議的平衡救了你一命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "年輕人，達里奧判斷你已經有了奔赴前線的意志，你才會出現在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還不成熟，但你躍躍欲試，有著活力與堅韌的軀體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但格蘭法洛的任務不比鹽風城的輕鬆，只會更加深入邪惡的中心，你是否做好了準備？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了守衛伊比利亞的潔淨與德行，我才提起了劍與燈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這對我而言，不只是一句口號。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她會做好準備的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我相信你的判斷，但命運往往不給人準備的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我與那位凱爾希醫生還有些事要處理，帶領深海獵人小隊重返伊比利亞之眼的任務，就交給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊比利亞之眼......長官，我們具體要怎麼做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......建立營地，維護道路，確保維修師能安全抵達大燈塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從格蘭法洛最近的海岸線出發，約五十海里即可抵達最後一座伊比利亞之眼所在的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前提是，那座燈塔還在地圖上它所在的位置上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "五十海里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曾經我們的艦隊能遠眺平靜的海面。可大靜謐後，海洋就像是一鍋沸騰的毒物，能融化一切碰觸到它的事物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是一次艱巨的任務。但奪回最後一座燈塔，同樣對我們意義重大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我明白！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為此，我們需要那些阿戈爾人的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她已經去過了審判庭地下的囚籠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你已經見識過了審判庭探尋的真相，即使我們未能得出答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行動吧，年輕的審判官。時間不會等待，如有必要，我需要你們審判時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g16_lighthouse_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（響亮的窸窣聲）——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事吧？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒事，抱歉極境先生，我又拖了後腿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，哈哈，別在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些恐魚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（一致的傷痕，三三兩兩被砸進坑裡，這手筆，是斯卡蒂她們吧......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......鎮子，被破壞得好嚴重......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔——停下！喬迪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這、這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——螢光的，植被？浮游生物？還是珊......珊瑚？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面的路都被這種東西覆蓋了......等等，有什麼東西從屋簷上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！躲開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不、不——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——它們竟然已經在這裡築巢了？！它們不是單純地在深海教徒的指揮下進攻而已嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（而且......難道這麼多的數量，是剛剛誕生的？！這是什麼速度？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喬迪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，在、在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快逃！往反方向逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是後面也有，極境先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嘁，這些怪物築巢的速度真是比暗潮鉗獸的速度還快啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只能拼死一搏了，喂，喬迪，你隨便找點什麼東西當武器吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "傘、傘可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......今天確實像是要下雨啊。總之你握緊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐魚",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_457_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（響亮的窸窣聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！做好準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（得意的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——燒掉它。連著房屋一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "npc_10002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（愉悅的嘶鳴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來能夠清理溟痕的不止有阿戈爾的技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒事就好，發生了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這位略顯失態的阿戈爾人又是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g18_lighthouse_square"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出色的實力，獵人們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無需感歎，讓我們迅速進入下一個話題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些時日，凱爾希替你受了不少苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她對我們的幫助我會銘記在心，而你們所做的一切......我也不會忘記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但此刻的局面是她一手促成，一座狹窄的海邊小鎮，一場簡單的會面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看在她的面子上，我們就先以和平的態度對話吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想要找到布雷奧甘的遺產，你想找到斯圖提斐拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（斯圖提斐拉，“愚人號”？是在大靜謐之中全軍覆沒的艦隊旗艦的名字......？可是，都這麼多年了啊？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我更好奇的是，一介外人是如何確定它沒有沉沒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼以一位伊比利亞人的視角來看，您認為斯圖提斐拉號是否沉沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有沉沒的可能性，確實很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，它也沒有回到港灣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一艘船，六十餘年沒有沉沒，卻也不曾回到陸地的港口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們能確認它的方位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去可以，現在不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "歌蕾蒂婭望向一旁的雕塑。\n她對這些東西沒有印象，也許是她來到陸地的時候，這些建築已經在靜謐中消亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“伊比利亞之眼”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些奇跡曾是一個壯美計畫的基石，如今，大部分燈塔已經在大靜謐中遭到毀滅，只留下最後一座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不屬於你們。它屬於阿戈爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......布雷奧甘確實是一位阿戈爾人，他來自海洋，卻無私奉獻。他為伊比利亞的海洋探索做出了十足的貢獻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在災難之後，你們任由民眾將怒火傾瀉到阿戈爾人頭上——他的頭上，縱容愚行顯得你們不值得信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可阿戈爾人難道真與大靜謐無關？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隔閡永遠是死穴。如果二位執意要繼續這個話題，那伊比利亞與阿戈爾等同於已經滅亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "文明不會滅絕，它只會不知倦怠地更替。下一次，就和人類無關了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希醫生，請注意你與卡門閣下說話的態度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無妨，我們已經做了許多交流......不過，你總是這麼做嗎？凱爾希？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從龐大的命運體中剖取那些關鍵的個體，再說服他們以你的想法行事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的想法只是拯救你們。伊比利亞可以拒絕，阿戈爾同樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果算上這位年輕有為的少女，這裡的六人之中，審判庭與深海獵人各有三人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廣場上有著一位阿戈爾人所建造的伊比利亞奇觀，作為談判桌的點綴，再適合不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此刻，溟痕還在蔓延，恐魚已經在鎮上築巢，它們的存在形式與先前大不相同。這種“不同處”足以讓人緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果各位還沒有認清海洋威脅的全貌，也許我們的確該各退一步，然後坐視以深海獵人的犧牲換來的寶貴時間白白流逝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "speakerId": "char_263_skadi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那場勝利，是有意義的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。否則在大靜謐之後，伊比利亞連苟延殘喘的機會都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於卡門閣下，我希望您能暫時放下對於阿戈爾的成見。以您的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我已經很老了，凱爾希，不必浪費時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經老到不再有爭勝的心態，或是在言語上維護榮耀的力氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生存就是最偉大的榮耀，我比任何人都清楚現狀，收起你的言辭。審判庭願意與深海獵人合作，幫助她們找到那艘遺失的大船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽靈鯊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1023_ghost2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......黃金的......大船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有異議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為你們會忌憚阿戈爾與伊比利亞的接觸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接觸？啊......如果您能在水下呼吸，不借助設備就前往我們的城市的話，我不介意帶您參觀真正的阿戈爾技術展覽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "令人期待，執政官閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個大陣的懲戒軍與數艘兩用軍艦將會抵達格蘭法洛，設立營地，清掃港口，以作準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "達里奧，艾麗妮，你們與幾位深海獵人同行。優先確保通往伊比利亞之眼的海路，等我們抵達再做判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遵命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凱爾希，如果......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果機不可失，我會優先選擇與阿戈爾重建聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深入海洋對任何人來說都是一件危險的事情，但於你們而言，這只是一次返鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會找到那艘船，你也會找到回到阿戈爾的方法，這交由你自己判斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許，我們下次再見，會是很久以後。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要別忘記我們所說的。希望你回到阿戈爾以後，能重新審視一遍阿戈爾遭遇的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼事不宜遲，我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "極境",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_450_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......凱爾希醫生，抱歉，從聽到燈塔的那部分開始，喬迪他就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......阿戈爾人，正好。我有許多事情要問你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我......我是這個鎮子的鎮民，我叫喬迪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蘭法洛不該還有本地的阿戈爾人！卷宗顯示，這裡本就有阿戈爾人與深海教會勾結的劣跡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的父母是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我的父母是燈塔維修師。他們為伊比利亞之眼而犧牲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家裡擺滿了塵封的圖紙，我......雖然我沒有真的見過那座燈塔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想去見一見......我故鄉的意義，我父母為之奮鬥一生的意義......我，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能。你應當先接受審判庭的詢問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我並不認為在廝殺中保護一個弱小的工人是什麼高效的提議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他是布雷奧甘的後人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "歌蕾蒂婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_474_gladiia_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？可他和影像記錄裡的布雷奧甘完全不像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即便是真的，我們也應當要求他上繳家族留下的遺產，由審判庭接手研究。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "長官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大審判官達里奧",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_183",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿戈爾人，你叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......喬迪，喬迪·方塔納羅薩，這是叔叔告訴我的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你應該知道，主動出現在審判庭的面前會遭遇什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喬迪",
      "speakerId": "avg_4042_lumen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾麗妮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扣押他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......讓他與你們同行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "審判官艾麗妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_4009_irene_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......呃，什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣才如你所願，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感謝閣下。不過我更願見到的，是阿戈爾與伊比利亞長久的、真正的合作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "聖徒卡門",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_447_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千里之行始於足下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，事不宜遲，讓伊比利亞之眼重新看看這片滿目瘡痍的海洋吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
